<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 9.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 9.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian state radio reported the following headlines on its noon news programme. Reuters has not verified these headlines and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- NATO and Ukraine sign an agreement</p>
<p>- The head of the state police, Police General Aldis Lieljuksis took up a post in a security firm although this was banned by the new anti-corruption law.</p>
<p>- A German Bundestag delegation is visiting the Baltic states and St Petersburg.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
